#. あの、苗木君…
msgctxt "0001 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Umm, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. 少しだけ、私の話を聞いてもらってもいいですか？
msgctxt "0002 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Do you think you could make time for the two of us to\n"
"talk?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしたの…？
#. 急に改まっちゃって…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What's wrong? Why are you being so formal?"
msgstr ""

#. あのですね…急に改まっちゃって言いますけど…
msgctxt "0004 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"W-Well, it's just... I guess that was kind of formal,\n"
"but..."
msgstr ""

#. 私、苗木君の事を、
#. 頼りにしてますから。
msgctxt "0005 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "...it's just because I know I can count on you."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君がいてくれた事が、
#. 本当に心強いんです。
msgctxt "0007 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Having you by my side really makes me feel a lot\n"
"better."
msgstr ""

#. もし、苗木君がいなかったら、
#. どんなに心細かったか…
msgctxt "0008 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"If you weren't here with me, I just don't know what\n"
"I'd do. I'd be lost..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな災難に巻き込まれたのは怖いですけど、
#. でも苗木君がいるから、なんか安心なんです。
msgctxt "0009 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I hate that we had to meet again under such awful\n"
"conditions, but...I'm relieved you're with me."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さん…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの舞園さんから面と向かって、
#. そんな風に言われるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Standing here face to face and hearing her say that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>嬉しいけど…さすがに照れるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's nice, but...kind of embarrassing at the same\n"
"time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それは、ボクも同じ気持ちだよ…
#. 舞園さんがいてくれて助かってるよ…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I...know how you feel. You being here is what saved\n"
"me..."
msgstr ""

#. ホントですか！？
msgctxt "0014 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "R-Really?"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、お世辞でも嬉しいですよ…
msgctxt "0015 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ehehe. Thank you for the flattery."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの笑顔…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That smile...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの心を和ませてくれる不思議な笑顔…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That mysterious smile that softens my heart...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>お世辞なんかじゃない。
#. この笑顔のお陰でボクは助かってるんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really wasn't flattering her. That smile saved me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …でも、なんだか不思議ですね。
msgctxt "0019 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But it's kind of strange, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか、苗木君とこんな風に仲良く話せるとは、
#. 思っていませんでしたから…
msgctxt "0020 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd get a chance to really talk to you\n"
"like this."
msgstr ""

#. 中学校の時は、私と話してくれないどころか、
#. あんまり目も合わせてくれなかったでしょう？
msgctxt "0021 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"All through middle school, you never talked to me.\n"
"In fact, you never even looked at me."
msgstr ""

#. だって、舞園さんは有名人だしさ…
#. あんまりジロジロ見る訳にも…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's because you were like a celebrity. I couldn't\n"
"just go around staring at you..."
msgstr ""

#. …って、あれ？　どうして知ってるの？
#. ボクが目も合わせなかったって…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Wait, how do you know I never looked at you?"
msgstr ""

#. 私が苗木君の事を、
#. ちょくちょく見ていたからですよ。
msgctxt "0024 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Because I looked at you all the time..."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ずっと、<CLT 3>苗木君に話しかける機会<CLT>を
#. うかがってたんです。
msgctxt "0026 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I was always looking for <CLT 3>an opportunity to talk to\n"
"you<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ボクに…話しかける機会を…？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You...wanted to talk to me?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、私の周りにいつも人がいたせいで、
#. 結局、話せずじまいで卒業…
msgctxt "0028 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But since I always had so many people around me,\n"
"we ended up graduating without saying a word."
msgstr ""

#. それが心残りだったんです。
msgctxt "0029 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "That was one of my biggest regrets."
msgstr ""

#. でも…どうしてボクなんかに…？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...why me?"
msgstr ""

#. 中学１年生の時…
#. 学校の池に大きな鳥が迷い込んで来ましたよね？
msgctxt "0031 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Do you remember during our first year of junior high,\n"
"that huge bird wandered into the school pond?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば、あったかも…
#. そんな事…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Actually, now that I think about it...I do sorta\n"
"remember something like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 日本の昔話にもよく登場して、
#. なんとかは千年、亀は万年…って鳥ですよ。
msgctxt "0033 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"It was like out of a fairy tale. The turtle once every\n"
"million years, that bird once every thousand..."
msgstr ""

#. 鶴
msgctxt "0034 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Crane"
msgstr ""

#. 鷺
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Heron"
msgstr ""

#. 鷺じゃなかったかな？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was a...heron, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. いえ、鷺じゃないです。
#. 似てますけど…もっと大きかったです。
msgctxt "0037 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"No, not quite. It was similar, but even bigger than\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鷺に似てて、もっと大きい？
#. それは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Like a heron but bigger? That'd have to be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 雀
msgctxt "0039 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Sparrow"
msgstr ""

#. 雀？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A...sparrow, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 雀なら、いつも当たり前にいましたよ？
#. それはもう、たくさん…
msgctxt "0041 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But sparrows were really common around there, right?\n"
"We had a whole flock living there..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、雀も昔話にはよく出てきますよね！
#. 大きなつづらと小さなつづらのお話とか…
msgctxt "0042 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Oh, but sparrows do show up in all kinds of fairy\n"
"tales! Like that one, The Tongue-Cut Sparrow!"
msgstr ""

#. そうだね…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, true..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、あの時、池に来たのは
#. もっともっと大きな鳥だったんです。
msgctxt "0044 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "But no, the bird we saw that day was a lot bigger."
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0045 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. 日本の昔話にもよく登場して…
#. なんとかは千年、亀は万年…って鳥…
msgctxt "0046 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"It's in a lot of fairy tales. The kind of thing that\n"
"shows up once every thousand years..."
msgstr ""

#. もうちょっとで思い出せそうなんですけど…
msgctxt "0047 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "It's on the tip of my tongue..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中学１年生の時に…
#. 学校の池に迷い込んできた大きな鳥か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A huge bird wandered into the school pond during our\n"
"first year of junior high...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれって、確か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think it might have been...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …鶴だよね。学校の池に鶴が迷い込んで来たんだ。
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was a crane! It just walked right into the pond."
msgstr ""

#. すごかったですよね。だって鶴ですもんね。
msgctxt "0051 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "That's right! That's what it was."
msgstr ""

#. あんまり大きな鳥だから、
#. 先生も驚いて、何も出来なかったのに…
msgctxt "0052 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "It was so big, the teacher had no idea what to do."
msgstr ""

#. …苗木君が逃がしてあげたんですよね？
#. あの鶴を学校の裏の森まで…
msgctxt "0053 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"But you led it into the forest behind the school.\n"
"You helped it find its way out."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>飼育委員だったせいで…
#. 無理矢理やらされただけだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, only cuz I was already in charge of taking care\n"
"of the animals at school. They made me do it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あの時のお礼…
#. 今、言わせてもらってもいいですか？
msgctxt "0055 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I should have said thank you then, but...is it okay if\n"
"I do it now?"
msgstr ""

#. …お礼？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Thank me...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私があの鶴なんです。恩返しに来ました。
#. 布を織らせてください…
msgctxt "0057 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I'm that crane, you see. I've come to return the\n"
"favor. Here, let me make you a cloak..."
msgstr ""

#. …なんて、冗談ですよ。
msgctxt "0058 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ehehe. Just kidding!"
msgstr ""

#. うん…わかってるよ…
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I kinda figured..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、私が感心したのは本当ですよ。
msgctxt "0060 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Honestly though, I was so impressed..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、そんな苗木君と、
#. 一度、話してみたかったんです。
msgctxt "0061 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"That's why I always wanted to talk to you, even just\n"
"once."
msgstr ""

#. それが、こんな形で実現するとは、
#. 思ってもいませんでしたけどね…
msgctxt "0062 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I never imagined this would be how I got my chance..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし、これが街中だったりしたら、
#. ドラマチックな再会になったのかもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah. If we'd met again at a train station somewhere\n"
"downtown, that'd make for a nice dramatic reunion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、その舞台が…
#. こんな不気味な学園じゃな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But instead, it's this weird school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …でも、私は思うんです。
msgctxt "0065 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Maybe, but still..."
msgstr ""

#. あの時の鶴みたいに、
#. きっと苗木君が私の事を救ってくれるんだって。
msgctxt "0066 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you'll help me find my way out, just like\n"
"that crane. You'll save me."
msgstr ""

#. ただの勘かもしれませんけど、
#. なんか、そんな気がするんです。
msgctxt "0067 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "It's just intuition, I know, but I still believe it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが…舞園さんを救う…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm going to save her...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うん、頑張るよ。
#. それが、ただの勘で終わらないように…
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'll do my best, I promise that. I'll make sure it's\n"
"more than just intuition."
msgstr ""

#. ボクに出来る事があれば、
#. なんでもするつもりだよ。
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If there's anything I can do, I'm going to do it...!"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん信じてますよ。
#. だって、私の勘はすっごく当たるんです。
msgctxt "0071 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"I believe in you. Besides, my intuition always turns\n"
"out to be right."
msgstr ""

#. …エスパーですから。
msgctxt "0072 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Cuz I'm psychic."
msgstr ""

#. うふふ、冗談ですよ。
msgctxt "0073 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ehehe. Kidding, kidding!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、舞園さんはまた笑った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She laughed out loud as she said it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女との距離が近くなればなるほど
#. その笑みがボクの力になっていくような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The closer we get, the stronger that smile of hers\n"
"makes me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…そんな気がした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I was glad to feel that way.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>舞園さやかの<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sayaka's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“美声”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Melodious Voice<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんと別れた後、
#. ボクはいったん、自分の部屋に帰る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once we were all done, I headed back to my room for a\n"
"little while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
